# Frontend environment variables (names only -- no real values here).
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides, or set these directly in your hosting
# provider's dashboard (e.g. Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables).
#
# Leave unset for local dev -- Vite's dev-server proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards
# /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000 automatically.
#
# In production, set this to your deployed backend's URL, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
